    "If verification is delayed and you cannot continue with a transaction, [[khidmat-pelanggan-__SLUG__|contact __BRAND__ customer service]], available 24 hours via live chat and WhatsApp. Have your username and a short description of the problem ready so help arrives faster. You can also browse the [[home#faq|FAQ on the __BRAND__ home page]] for quick answers to frequent issues.",
